WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:06.660
Well, the last song I listened to on repeat is called La Distancia.

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:14.140
It's a song by an artist from Cartagena, a Colombian artist, Manuel Medrano.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:22.640
I've listened to it many times because first of all I really love it, it has really beautiful lyrics.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:30.220
And second, because it reminds me of a story I've lived through.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:37.240
So, it's like every time, I listen to the song and I live that story again.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:42.260
It also helps me get through the moment.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:44.300
Music helps us heal.
